{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜Anthropic收購一人藥廠 藉AI推動罕見病治療研發進程           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">人工智能企業Anthropic宣布收購僅由一人營運的藥企Mithril Medicine，拓展罕見病治療領域。該藥企利用Anthropic的AI模型Claude協助營運及研發，僅用不足18個月就將一種罕見肌肉營養不良症潛在療法推進至小鼠實驗階段，取得正面成果。Anthropic預計相關候選藥物最快2028年底可開展人體臨床試驗。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:36.161535+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:38.785621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:38.785621+00:00","content_hash":"bd6caedd9458a2385277d70f1a14176f00410f1b737cd8338cac567877d32e2c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}